<title>USA: Bufete unit wins $16.3 mln Chile contract.</title>
<headline>Bufete unit wins $16.3 mln Chile contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Bufete Industrial SA de CV said Monday its Chilean unit, Empresas do Obras y Montajes Ovalle Moore SA, has won a contract worth $16.3 million to build tunneling complexes in Valparaiso, Chile.</p>
<p>The company said the contract calls for the construction of 2,500 meters of tunnels and the conversion of six access shafts to improve the city's sewage system. The project is scheduled to be completed in August 1998.</p>
